<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>{{TITLE}}</title>
<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,400;0,9..144,500;0,9..144,600;0,9..144,700;1,9..144,400;1,9..144,500&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');

:root{
  --paper:#f4efe4; --paper-2:#ece4d4; --paper-3:#e3d9c5;
  --surface:#fbf8f1; --card:#fdfbf5; --card-2:#f6f0e2;
  --ink-bg:#1c1813; --ink-bg-2:#272019;
  --rule:#dcd3c1; --rule-soft:#e9e1d1; --rule-strong:#c8bca3;
  --ink:#211d18; --ink-2:#4b443b; --ink-dim:#7d7568; --ink-faint:#a59c8c;
  --on-dark:#efe7d8; --on-dark-dim:#b9ad97;
  --clay:#c75b39; --clay-2:#d97757; --clay-soft:rgba(199,91,57,.10); --clay-line:rgba(199,91,57,.32);
  --blue:#2f6f9f; --blue-soft:rgba(47,111,159,.10);
  --olive:#5f7138; --olive-soft:rgba(95,113,56,.12);
  --plum:#6e4a86; --plum-soft:rgba(110,74,134,.10);
  --amber:#c1882a; --amber-soft:rgba(193,136,42,.12);
  --rose:#b1556c; --rose-soft:rgba(177,85,108,.10);
  --serif:'Fraunces','Iowan Old Style',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;
  --sans:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;
  --mono:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;
  --sh-sm:0 1px 2px rgba(60,45,25,.06),0 1px 2px rgba(60,45,25,.05);
  --sh-md:0 4px 16px rgba(60,45,25,.10),0 1px 4px rgba(60,45,25,.06);
  --sh-lg:0 18px 44px rgba(60,45,25,.16),0 6px 14px rgba(60,45,25,.09);
  --sh-xl:0 34px 80px rgba(40,30,15,.26),0 12px 26px rgba(40,30,15,.12);
  --rail:288px; --wrap:1080px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
html,body{margin:0;padding:0}
body{
  background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink); font-family:var(--sans);
  font-size:16px; line-height:1.62; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(60,45,25,.028) 1px,transparent 1px);
  background-size:26px 26px;
}
::selection{background:var(--clay-soft);color:var(--clay)}
a{color:var(--clay);text-decoration:none}
button{font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:none;background:none;color:inherit;padding:0}

#progress{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;height:3px;width:0;z-index:120;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--clay),var(--amber));transition:width .12s linear}

#rail{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:var(--rail);height:100vh;z-index:90;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--surface),var(--paper));
  border-right:1.5px solid var(--rule);
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:26px 22px 20px;overflow-y:auto}
#rail .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;margin-bottom:6px}
#rail .brand .mark{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;flex:none;
  background:linear-gradient(140deg,var(--clay-2),var(--clay));color:#fff;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--serif);
  font-weight:600;font-size:19px;box-shadow:var(--sh-sm)}
#rail .brand .bt{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:16px;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.01em}
#rail .brand .bs{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-dim)}
#rail .railhint{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--ink-faint);margin:18px 6px 9px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule-soft);padding-top:14px}
nav.toc{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px;flex:1}
nav.toc a{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:11px;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:8px;
  color:var(--ink-2);font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.3;transition:background .15s,color .15s;position:relative}
nav.toc a .n{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-faint);min-width:18px;flex:none;padding-top:1px}
nav.toc a:hover{background:var(--card-2);color:var(--ink)}
nav.toc a.active{background:var(--clay-soft);color:var(--clay)}
nav.toc a.active .n{color:var(--clay)}
nav.toc a.active::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:-22px;top:6px;bottom:6px;width:3px;border-radius:0 3px 3px 0;background:var(--clay)}
#rail .foot{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--ink-faint);
  margin-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule-soft);padding-top:12px;line-height:1.7}
#railToggle{display:none}

main{margin-left:var(--rail)}
/* paged: one chapter shown at a time — no infinite scroll */
.chapter{display:none;min-height:100vh;padding:70px 56px 150px;
  flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;position:relative}
.chapter.active{display:flex;animation:pagein .5s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)}
.chapter.dark{justify-content:center}
@keyframes pagein{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--wrap);margin:0 auto}
.wrap.wide{max-width:1280px}

.kicker{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--clay);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin-bottom:20px}
.kicker::before{content:"";width:26px;height:1.5px;background:var(--clay-line)}
.kicker.plain::before{display:none}
.display{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.022em;line-height:1.02;
  font-size:clamp(40px,6vw,76px);margin:0 0 22px;color:var(--ink)}
h2.title{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.06;
  font-size:clamp(30px,4.2vw,50px);margin:0 0 18px}
h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(20px,2.3vw,26px);letter-spacing:-.01em;
  margin:34px 0 12px;line-height:1.18}
h4{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:600;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.01em;margin:22px 0 8px;color:var(--ink)}
em,.it{font-style:italic}
.display em,h2.title em,h3 em{color:var(--clay);font-style:italic}
.lede{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(19px,2.1vw,24px);line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink-2);
  font-weight:400;max-width:58ch;margin:0 0 8px}
.prose{max-width:68ch}
.prose p{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--ink-2)}
.prose p strong,strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
.prose .lead-in{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:20px}
.dropcap::first-letter{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;float:left;font-size:62px;line-height:.82;
  padding:6px 12px 0 0;color:var(--clay)}
.small{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-dim)}
.mono{font-family:var(--mono)}

.pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;
  letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:100px;
  border:1.5px solid var(--rule-strong);color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--surface)}
.pill.clay{border-color:var(--clay-line);color:var(--clay);background:var(--clay-soft)}
.pill.blue{border-color:rgba(47,111,159,.3);color:var(--blue);background:var(--blue-soft)}
.pill.olive{border-color:rgba(95,113,56,.3);color:var(--olive);background:var(--olive-soft)}
.pill.plum{border-color:rgba(110,74,134,.3);color:var(--plum);background:var(--plum-soft)}
.pill.amber{border-color:rgba(193,136,42,.3);color:var(--amber);background:var(--amber-soft)}
.pillrow{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:0 0 6px}

.grid{display:grid;gap:18px;margin:26px 0}
.grid-2{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
.grid-3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
.grid-4{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1.5px solid var(--rule);border-radius:13px;padding:22px 22px 20px;
  transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s,border-color .2s;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:var(--sh-md);border-color:var(--rule-strong)}
.card .cnum{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--clay);letter-spacing:.1em;margin-bottom:11px;display:block}
.card .ctitle{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 8px;line-height:1.2}
.card .cbody{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55}
.card.accent{border-top:3px solid var(--clay)}
.card.blue{border-top:3px solid var(--blue)}
.card.olive{border-top:3px solid var(--olive)}
.card.plum{border-top:3px solid var(--plum)}
.card.amber{border-top:3px solid var(--amber)}
.card.glow{background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--card),var(--card-2))}

.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:16px;margin:26px 0}
.stat{border-left:3px solid var(--clay);padding:4px 0 4px 16px}
.stat .sv{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,44px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--ink)}
.stat .sl{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-dim);margin-top:8px}
.stat.blue{border-color:var(--blue)} .stat.olive{border-color:var(--olive)}
.stat.plum{border-color:var(--plum)} .stat.amber{border-color:var(--amber)}

.quote{border-left:3px solid var(--clay);padding:6px 0 6px 26px;margin:32px 0;max-width:48ch}
.quote p{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(21px,2.6vw,28px);line-height:1.4;
  color:var(--ink);margin:0 0 12px;font-weight:400}
.quote .cite{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-dim)}
.quote.big{border:none;padding:0;max-width:44ch;margin:10px 0}
.quote.big p{font-size:clamp(24px,3.3vw,36px);line-height:1.22}

.callout{display:flex;gap:14px;background:var(--card);border:1.5px solid var(--rule);
  border-left:3px solid var(--clay);border-radius:0 11px 11px 0;padding:18px 20px;margin:24px 0}
.callout .ci{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--clay);flex:none;padding-top:3px;writing-mode:horizontal-tb}
.callout .cc{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55}
.callout .cc strong{color:var(--ink)}
.callout.warn{border-left-color:var(--amber);background:var(--amber-soft)} .callout.warn .ci{color:var(--amber)}
.callout.ok{border-left-color:var(--olive);background:var(--olive-soft)} .callout.ok .ci{color:var(--olive)}
.callout.idea{border-left-color:var(--plum);background:var(--plum-soft)} .callout.idea .ci{color:var(--plum)}
.callout.bad{border-left-color:var(--rose);background:var(--rose-soft)} .callout.bad .ci{color:var(--rose)}

.steps{list-style:none;counter-reset:s;padding:0;margin:24px 0;display:grid;gap:14px}
.steps li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:34px 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:start}
.steps li::before{counter-increment:s;content:counter(s);grid-column:1;align-self:start;
  width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid var(--clay-line);background:var(--clay-soft);
  color:var(--clay);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.steps li > *{grid-column:2}
.steps li h4{margin:5px 0 4px}
.steps li p{margin:0;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-2)}

.compare{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin:26px 0}
.col{border:1.5px solid var(--rule);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;background:var(--card)}
.col .clabel{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;
  margin-bottom:12px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
.col.bad{border-color:rgba(177,85,108,.28);background:var(--rose-soft)}
.col.bad .clabel{color:var(--rose)}
.col.good{border-color:rgba(95,113,56,.32);background:var(--olive-soft)}
.col.good .clabel{color:var(--olive)}
.col ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px} .col li{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-2)}

.code{background:var(--ink-bg);border:1.5px solid var(--ink-bg-2);border-radius:11px;
  padding:18px 20px;margin:22px 0;overflow-x:auto;box-shadow:var(--sh-sm)}
.code pre{margin:0;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#e7decd;white-space:pre}
.code .cm{color:#9c8f76} .code .k{color:#e0a578} .code .s{color:#a9c08a} .code .v{color:#8fb6d4}
.codecap{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--ink-faint);margin:-12px 0 14px;padding-left:4px}
kbd{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;background:var(--paper-2);border:1.5px solid var(--rule-strong);
  border-bottom-width:2.5px;border-radius:5px;padding:2px 7px;color:var(--ink-2)}

.fig{border:1.5px solid var(--rule);border-radius:14px;background:var(--surface);padding:26px 24px 16px;
  margin:28px 0;box-shadow:var(--sh-sm)}
.fig.bare{border:none;background:none;box-shadow:none;padding:8px 0}
.fig svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;overflow:visible}
.fig .fcap{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink-dim);
  text-align:center;margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule-soft);padding-top:12px}
.fig .fcap b{color:var(--ink-2);font-weight:600}

.s-card{fill:var(--card);stroke:var(--rule-strong);stroke-width:1.5}
.s-clay{fill:var(--clay)} .s-clay-f{fill:var(--clay-soft);stroke:var(--clay);stroke-width:1.5}
.s-blue-f{fill:var(--blue-soft);stroke:var(--blue);stroke-width:1.5}
.s-olive-f{fill:var(--olive-soft);stroke:var(--olive);stroke-width:1.5}
.s-plum-f{fill:var(--plum-soft);stroke:var(--plum);stroke-width:1.5}
.s-amber-f{fill:var(--amber-soft);stroke:var(--amber);stroke-width:1.5}
.s-ink{fill:var(--ink)} .s-dim{fill:var(--ink-dim)}
.s-line{stroke:var(--rule-strong);stroke-width:1.5;fill:none}
.s-flow{stroke:var(--clay);stroke-width:2;fill:none}
.s-label{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;fill:var(--ink-2);letter-spacing:.04em}
.s-label-sm{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;fill:var(--ink-dim);letter-spacing:.06em}
.s-title{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;font-weight:600;fill:var(--ink)}
.s-serif{font-family:var(--serif);fill:var(--ink)}

.draw path,.draw line,.draw circle,.draw rect,.draw polyline,.draw polygon{
  stroke-dasharray:var(--len,1200);stroke-dashoffset:var(--len,1200);transition:stroke-dashoffset 1.3s ease}
.draw.drawn path,.draw.drawn line,.draw.drawn circle,.draw.drawn rect,.draw.drawn polyline,.draw.drawn polygon{stroke-dashoffset:0}

.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px);transition:opacity .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1),transform .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)}
.reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
.reveal.d1{transition-delay:.07s} .reveal.d2{transition-delay:.14s} .reveal.d3{transition-delay:.21s}
.reveal.d4{transition-delay:.28s} .reveal.d5{transition-delay:.35s} .reveal.d6{transition-delay:.42s}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.reveal{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:none}
  .draw path,.draw line,.draw circle,.draw rect,.draw polyline,.draw polygon{stroke-dashoffset:0}}

.chapter.dark{background:radial-gradient(120% 90% at 78% 8%,#332821 0%,var(--ink-bg) 46%,#161210 100%);
  color:var(--on-dark);border-bottom:none}
.chapter.dark .kicker{color:var(--clay-2)} .chapter.dark .kicker::before{background:rgba(217,119,87,.5)}
.chapter.dark .display,.chapter.dark h2.title{color:#f6efe2}
.chapter.dark .display em{color:var(--clay-2)}
.chapter.dark .lede{color:var(--on-dark-dim)}
.chapter.dark .small{color:var(--on-dark-dim)}
.chapter.dark .prose p{color:var(--on-dark-dim)}
.chapter.dark .prose p strong{color:#f6efe2}
.chapter.dark .pill{background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.16);color:var(--on-dark-dim)}
.chapter.dark .pill.clay{color:var(--clay-2);border-color:rgba(217,119,87,.4);background:rgba(217,119,87,.1)}
.chapter.dark .quote p{color:#f6efe2}
.chapter.dark .card{background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.12)}
.chapter.dark .card .cbody{color:var(--on-dark-dim)}
.chapter.dark .card .ctitle{color:#f6efe2}

.chapnum{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--ink-faint);
  display:inline-block;margin-bottom:14px}
.divline{height:1.5px;background:var(--rule);border:none;margin:36px 0}
.row{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
.spread{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:46px;align-items:center}
.spread.rev{grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr}
.center{text-align:center}
.maxw{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto}
.tag-list{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin:14px 0}
.tag-list .t{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-dim);padding:3px 9px;
  border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:6px;background:var(--surface)}
.sig{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-size:28px;color:var(--clay);margin-top:8px}
.jump{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;
  letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--clay);margin-top:30px;
  padding:9px 16px;border:1.5px solid var(--clay-line);border-radius:100px;background:var(--clay-soft);
  transition:gap .18s,background .18s}
.jump:hover{gap:13px;background:var(--clay);color:#fff}

/* ── in-chapter contents nav (sticky) ──────────────────── */
.chapnav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:22px 0 6px;padding:13px 16px;
  background:rgba(251,248,241,.92);border:1.5px solid var(--rule-strong);border-radius:13px;
  position:sticky;top:12px;z-index:46;box-shadow:var(--sh-sm);backdrop-filter:saturate(1.3) blur(9px)}
.chapnav .cnl{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--ink-faint);margin-right:4px}
.chapnav a{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.03em;color:var(--ink-2);
  padding:5px 11px;border:1.5px solid var(--rule);border-radius:100px;background:var(--card);transition:all .15s}
.chapnav a:hover{color:var(--clay);border-color:var(--clay-line);background:var(--clay-soft)}
.chapnav a.cur{color:#fff;border-color:var(--clay);background:var(--clay)}
.chapnav a.cur b{color:#fff}
.chapnav a b{color:var(--clay);font-weight:600;margin-right:6px}

/* ── subsection header (numbered band) ─────────────────── */
.subsec{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px;margin:10px 0 2px;scroll-margin-top:30px}
.subsec .sn{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#fff;
  background:linear-gradient(140deg,var(--clay-2),var(--clay));
  width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:9px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  flex:none;box-shadow:var(--sh-sm)}
.subsec.blue .sn{background:linear-gradient(140deg,#4a8cbf,var(--blue))}
.subsec.olive .sn{background:linear-gradient(140deg,#7b9150,var(--olive))}
.subsec.plum .sn{background:linear-gradient(140deg,#8a66a6,var(--plum))}
.subsec.amber .sn{background:linear-gradient(140deg,#d6a24a,var(--amber))}
.subsec h2,.subsec h3{margin:0}

/* ── file tree (dark, like the code block) ─────────────── */
.filetree{background:var(--ink-bg);border:1.5px solid var(--ink-bg-2);border-radius:11px;
  padding:18px 22px;margin:22px 0;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.85;
  color:#e7decd;overflow-x:auto;box-shadow:var(--sh-sm);white-space:pre}
.filetree .d{color:#e0a578;font-weight:600}
.filetree .f{color:#cfc4b0}
.filetree .c{color:#9c8f76}
.filetree .hl{color:#a9c08a}

/* annotated code: caption + body pairing already via .codecap + .code */
.note{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-dim);font-style:italic;margin:-10px 0 16px;padding-left:4px}

/* ── "from the lecture" video stills band ──────────────── */
.lecband{margin:30px 0 8px;padding:22px 22px 18px;border:1.5px solid var(--rule-strong);border-radius:16px;
  background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--card),var(--card-2))}
.lecband .lechead{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;
  letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--clay);margin-bottom:12px}
.lecband .lechead::before{content:"▶";font-size:10px}
.lecband .lecintro{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6;max-width:74ch;margin:0 0 6px}
.lecband .lecintro strong{color:var(--ink)}
.stillgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(248px,1fr));gap:15px;margin:18px 0 8px}
.still{border:1.5px solid var(--rule);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--ink-bg);
  box-shadow:var(--sh-sm);transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}
.still:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:var(--sh-md)}
.still.hero{grid-column:1 / -1}
.still img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}
.still figcaption{padding:11px 14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--card);line-height:1.5}
.still figcaption b{display:block;color:var(--clay);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;
  letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px}
.lecband .watch{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;font-family:var(--mono);
  font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--clay);border:1.5px solid var(--clay-line);
  padding:7px 14px;border-radius:100px;background:var(--clay-soft)}
.lecband .watch:hover{background:var(--clay);color:#fff}

/* ── pager (prev / indicator / next) ───────────────────── */
#pager{position:fixed;bottom:22px;left:calc(50% + var(--rail)/2);transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:80;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;padding:6px;border-radius:100px;
  background:rgba(251,248,241,.94);border:1.5px solid var(--rule-strong);box-shadow:var(--sh-lg);backdrop-filter:blur(10px)}
#pager button{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;
  color:var(--ink-2);font-size:20px;line-height:1;transition:all .15s}
#pager button:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--clay-soft);color:var(--clay)}
#pager button:disabled{opacity:.28;cursor:default}
#pager .pind{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--ink-dim);padding:0 14px;min-width:78px;text-align:center}
#pager .pind b{color:var(--clay);font-weight:600}
#topbtn{position:fixed;right:22px;bottom:22px;z-index:80;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--clay);color:#fff;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  box-shadow:var(--sh-lg);font-size:17px}
#topbtn.show{display:flex}
#pgbar{position:fixed;bottom:78px;left:var(--rail);right:0;height:0;z-index:79;pointer-events:none}

/* ── syntax-highlight tokens (added by the inline highlighter) ── */
.code .n{color:#cf9d6a}.code .b{color:#d98f7a}.code .fn{color:#e0b083}
.code .md-h{color:#e0a578;font-weight:600}.code .md-b{color:#f1e9d8;font-weight:600}
.code .md-c{color:#a9c08a}.code .md-li{color:#e0a578}.code .md-q{color:#9c8f76;font-style:italic}.code .md-link{color:#8fb6d4}

@media (max-width:1100px){
  .spread,.spread.rev{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}
  .grid-4{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
}
@media (max-width:980px){
  :root{--rail:0px}
  #rail{transform:translateX(-100%);transition:transform .25s;width:280px;box-shadow:var(--sh-xl)}
  #rail.open{transform:none}
  main{margin-left:0}
  #railToggle{display:flex;position:fixed;top:14px;left:14px;z-index:100;width:44px;height:44px;
    border-radius:11px;background:var(--clay);color:#fff;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    box-shadow:var(--sh-md);font-size:18px}
  .chapter{padding:80px 26px 70px}
  .grid-2,.grid-3,.compare{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
@media (max-width:560px){ .grid-4{grid-template-columns:1fr} }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="progress"></div>
<button id="railToggle" aria-label="Menu">☰</button>

<aside id="rail">
  <!-- BRAND: replace mark letter/glyph, title, subtitle -->
  <div class="brand">
    <div class="mark">G</div>
    <div>
      <div class="bt">{{TITLE}}</div>
      <div class="bs">{{SUBTITLE}}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- TABLE OF CONTENTS: one <a href="#chNN"> per section, in order.
       Optional <div class="railhint">GROUP NAME</div> dividers between groups.
       ch00 = cover, last = send-off. The nav drives the paged navigation. -->
  <nav class="toc" id="toc">
    <a href="#ch00"><span class="n">00</span><span>Cover</span></a>
    <div class="railhint">Part I · Group name</div>
    <a href="#ch01"><span class="n">01</span><span>First section title</span></a>
    <a href="#ch02"><span class="n">02</span><span>Second section title</span></a>
    <!-- … add one <a> per section … -->
    <div class="railhint">∞ · Send-off</div>
    <a href="#ch99"><span class="n">99</span><span>Closing</span></a>
  </nav>
  <div class="foot">
    {{FOOTER_LINE}}<br>
    Press <kbd>J</kbd>/<kbd>K</kbd> to turn pages<br>
    Made with HTML, on purpose.
  </div>
</aside>

<main id="main">

<!-- ════════ CH00 · COVER (dark scene) ════════
     The cover sets the tone: a kicker, a big serif display headline with one clay <em>,
     a lede, a row of topic pills, and ONE bespoke animated SVG infographic.        -->
<section class="chapter dark" id="ch00">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker reveal">{{COVER_KICKER}}</div>
    <h1 class="display reveal d1" style="max-width:15ch">Your headline, with one <em>accent phrase.</em></h1>
    <p class="lede reveal d2" style="max-width:40ch;color:var(--on-dark-dim)">
      One or two sentences of standfirst that frame the whole document — what it is and why it matters.
    </p>

    <div class="row reveal d3" style="margin-top:34px;gap:10px">
      <span class="pill clay">topic</span>
      <span class="pill">topic</span>
      <span class="pill">topic</span>
      <span class="pill">N sections</span>
    </div>

    <div class="fig bare reveal d4" style="margin-top:46px;max-width:560px">
      <svg class="draw" viewBox="0 0 560 96" role="img" aria-label="From one engineer at a keyboard to a fleet of agents">
        <rect x="6" y="40" width="86" height="38" rx="9" fill="none" stroke="var(--on-dark-dim)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <text x="49" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--mono)" font-size="12" fill="#efe7d8">you</text>
        <path d="M92 59 C 150 59, 150 26, 214 26" stroke="var(--clay-2)" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
        <path d="M92 59 C 150 59, 150 59, 214 59" stroke="var(--clay-2)" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
        <path d="M92 59 C 150 59, 150 92, 214 92" stroke="var(--clay-2)" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
        <rect x="214" y="12" width="120" height="28" rx="7" fill="none" stroke="var(--olive)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="274" y="31" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--mono)" font-size="10.5" fill="var(--on-dark-dim)">plan agent</text>
        <rect x="214" y="45" width="120" height="28" rx="7" fill="none" stroke="var(--blue)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="274" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--mono)" font-size="10.5" fill="var(--on-dark-dim)">build agent</text>
        <rect x="214" y="78" width="120" height="28" rx="7" fill="none" stroke="var(--amber)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="274" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--mono)" font-size="10.5" fill="var(--on-dark-dim)">verify agent</text>
        <path d="M334 26 C 388 26, 388 59, 446 59" stroke="var(--clay-2)" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
        <path d="M334 59 H 446" stroke="var(--clay-2)" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
        <path d="M334 92 C 388 92, 388 59, 446 59" stroke="var(--clay-2)" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
        <circle cx="470" cy="59" r="13" fill="none" stroke="var(--clay-2)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <path d="M464 59 l5 5 8 -10" stroke="var(--clay-2)" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
        <text x="510" y="63" font-family="var(--mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--on-dark-dim)">shipped</text>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <p class="small reveal d5" style="margin-top:40px;font-family:var(--mono);letter-spacing:.06em">
      Scroll, or press <kbd style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.2);color:#efe7d8">J</kbd>
      to begin &nbsp;↓
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!--__CHAPTERS__-->

<!-- ════════ SEND-OFF (dark scene) — id must match the last TOC entry ════════ -->
<section class="chapter dark" id="ch99">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="chapnum reveal" style="color:var(--on-dark-dim)">— The Send-off</span>
    <div class="kicker reveal">Where this leaves you</div>
    <h2 class="title reveal d1" style="max-width:20ch;color:#f6efe2">A closing line, with one <em>accent.</em></h2>
    <p class="lede reveal d2" style="max-width:42ch;color:var(--on-dark-dim)">
      One or two sentences that land the thesis and send the reader off.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-3 reveal" style="margin-top:18px">
      <div class="card glow accent"><span class="cnum">RECAP 01</span><p class="ctitle">Key takeaway</p><p class="cbody">One-line recap of the first big idea.</p></div>
      <div class="card glow blue"><span class="cnum">RECAP 02</span><p class="ctitle">Key takeaway</p><p class="cbody">One-line recap of the second big idea.</p></div>
      <div class="card glow olive"><span class="cnum">RECAP 03</span><p class="ctitle">Key takeaway</p><p class="cbody">One-line recap of the third big idea.</p></div>
    </div>

    <div class="quote big reveal" style="margin:36px 0 8px">
      <p>A final, memorable one-liner.</p>
      <span class="cite" style="display:block;margin-top:14px;color:var(--on-dark-dim)">— the line to remember</span>
    </div>

    <p class="small reveal" style="margin-top:30px;color:var(--on-dark-dim)">
      {{COLOPHON}}<br>
      <span style="font-family:var(--mono);letter-spacing:.06em">Press <kbd style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.2);color:#efe7d8">K</kbd> to climb back up ↑</span>
    </p>
    <a class="jump reveal" href="#ch00" style="margin-top:26px">Back to the top &nbsp;↑</a>
  </div>
</section>

</main>

<div id="pager">
  <button id="pprev" aria-label="Previous section">‹</button>
  <span class="pind" id="pind"></span>
  <button id="pnext" aria-label="Next section">›</button>
</div>
<button id="topbtn" aria-label="Back to top">↑</button>

<script>
/* ═══ self-contained syntax highlighter ═══════════════════ */
function esc(s){return s.replace(/&/g,'&amp;').replace(/</g,'&lt;').replace(/>/g,'&gt;');}
const KW={
 python:['def','class','import','from','return','if','elif','else','for','while','in','not','and','or','is','None','True','False','with','as','try','except','finally','raise','lambda','yield','async','await','self','pass','break','continue','global'],
 js:['const','let','var','function','return','if','else','for','while','of','in','new','class','extends','import','export','default','async','await','try','catch','finally','throw','typeof','this','true','false','null','undefined','interface','type','enum','public','private','readonly'],
 bash:['if','then','else','elif','fi','for','do','done','while','case','esac','function','export','source','return','local','set','git','npm','npx','uv','uvx','bun','python','python3','node','claude','curl','mkdir','cd','echo','cat','cp','mv','rm','chmod'],
 yaml:['true','false','null'],
 json:['true','false','null'],
 text:[]
};
const COMMENT={python:'#',bash:'#',yaml:'#',js:'//',json:null,text:null};
function hlMd(e){
  return e.split('\n').map(function(line){
    if(/^#{1,6}\s/.test(line))return '<span class="md-h">'+line+'</span>';
    if(/^\s*&gt;/.test(line))return '<span class="md-q">'+line+'</span>';
    if(/^\s*([-*+]|\d+\.)\s/.test(line))line=line.replace(/^(\s*)([-*+]|\d+\.)(\s)/,'$1<span class="md-li">$2</span>$3');
    line=line.replace(/`([^`]+)`/g,'<span class="md-c">`$1`</span>');
    line=line.replace(/\*\*([^*]+)\*\*/g,'<span class="md-b">**$1**</span>');
    line=line.replace(/\[([^\]]+)\]\(([^)]+)\)/g,'<span class="md-link">[$1]($2)</span>');
    return line;
  }).join('\n');
}
function detectLang(pre){
  var cap=''; var c=pre.closest('.code'); if(c&&c.previousElementSibling&&c.previousElementSibling.classList.contains('codecap'))cap=c.previousElementSibling.textContent.toLowerCase();
  var t=pre.textContent;
  if(/\.md\b|markdown|\.claude\/commands|slash command|command file|prompt\.md|claude\.md/.test(cap)||/^#{1,6}\s.+/m.test(t)&&!/^\s*(def |import )/m.test(t))return'md';
  if(/\.py\b|python/.test(cap)||/^\s*(def |class |import |from \S+ import|print\()/m.test(t))return'python';
  if(/\.json\b|json|\.mcp|settings/.test(cap)||(/^\s*[\{\[]/.test(t.trim())&&/":\s/.test(t)))return'json';
  if(/\.(ts|js|tsx|jsx)\b|typescript|javascript/.test(cap)||/(=>|\bconst |\bfunction |\bexport )/.test(t))return'js';
  if(/\.ya?ml\b|yaml/.test(cap))return'yaml';
  if(/terminal|bash|shell|\.sh\b|justfile|command line/.test(cap)||/^\s*(\$|#!\/|git |cd |npm |uv |bun |export |curl )/m.test(t))return'bash';
  return'text';
}
function hl(text,lang){
  if(lang==='md')return hlMd(esc(text));
  var e=esc(text);
  var alts=['"(?:[^"\\\\]|\\\\.)*"',"'(?:[^'\\\\]|\\\\.)*'",'`(?:[^`\\\\]|\\\\.)*`'];
  var cm=COMMENT[lang];
  if(cm==='#')alts.push('#[^\\n]*');
  if(cm==='//')alts.push('//[^\\n]*');
  alts.push('\\b\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?\\b');
  var kw=KW[lang]||[];
  if(kw.length)alts.push('\\b(?:'+kw.join('|')+')\\b');
  var re=new RegExp(alts.join('|'),'g');
  return e.replace(re,function(m){
    var q=m.charAt(0);
    if(q==='"'||q==="'"||q==='`')return '<span class="s">'+m+'</span>';
    if(m.indexOf('#')===0||m.indexOf('//')===0)return '<span class="cm">'+m+'</span>';
    if(/^\d/.test(m))return '<span class="n">'+m+'</span>';
    return '<span class="k">'+m+'</span>';
  });
}
function highlightAll(){
  document.querySelectorAll('.code pre').forEach(function(pre){
    if(pre.dataset.hl)return;
    try{ pre.innerHTML=hl(pre.textContent,detectLang(pre)); }catch(e){}
    pre.dataset.hl='1';
  });
}
highlightAll();

/* ═══ paged navigation ════════════════════════════════════ */
var chapters=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.chapter'));
var tocLinks=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('#toc a'));
var prog=document.getElementById('progress');
var rail=document.getElementById('rail');
var idIndex={}; chapters.forEach(function(c,i){idIndex[c.id]=i;});
var cur=0, total=chapters.length;

var revObs=new IntersectionObserver(function(es){es.forEach(function(e){if(e.isIntersecting){e.target.classList.add('in','drawn');revObs.unobserve(e.target);}});},{rootMargin:'0px 0px -6% 0px',threshold:.1});
function wirePage(ch){
  ch.querySelectorAll('.draw').forEach(function(svg){
    svg.querySelectorAll('path,line,polyline,polygon,circle,rect').forEach(function(p){
      try{var len=p.getTotalLength?p.getTotalLength():1200;p.style.setProperty('--len',Math.ceil(len)||1200);}catch(e){}
    });
  });
  ch.querySelectorAll('.reveal,.draw').forEach(function(el){el.classList.remove('in','drawn');revObs.observe(el);});
}
var subObs=null;
function wireSubnav(ch){
  if(subObs)subObs.disconnect();
  var subs=[].slice.call(ch.querySelectorAll('.subsec[id]'));
  var links=[].slice.call(ch.querySelectorAll('.chapnav a'));
  if(!subs.length||!links.length)return;
  subObs=new IntersectionObserver(function(es){es.forEach(function(e){
    if(e.isIntersecting){links.forEach(function(a){a.classList.remove('cur');});
      var l=ch.querySelector('.chapnav a[href="#'+e.target.id+'"]'); if(l)l.classList.add('cur');}
  });},{rootMargin:'-15% 0px -75% 0px',threshold:0});
  subs.forEach(function(s){subObs.observe(s);});
}
function pageNum(i){var m=chapters[i].id.match(/ch(\d+)/);return m?m[1]:'00';}
function updatePager(){
  document.getElementById('pprev').disabled=cur<=0;
  document.getElementById('pnext').disabled=cur>=total-1;
  document.getElementById('pind').innerHTML='<b>'+pageNum(cur)+'</b> / '+String(total-1).padStart(2,'0');
}
function show(i,push){
  i=Math.max(0,Math.min(total-1,i));
  if(chapters[cur])chapters[cur].classList.remove('active');
  cur=i; var ch=chapters[i];
  ch.classList.add('active');
  wirePage(ch); wireSubnav(ch);
  window.scrollTo(0,0);
  tocLinks.forEach(function(a){a.classList.remove('active');});
  var rl=document.querySelector('#toc a[href="#'+ch.id+'"]'); if(rl){rl.classList.add('active');rl.scrollIntoView({block:'nearest'});}
  updatePager();
  if(push!==false){try{history.replaceState(null,'','#'+ch.id);}catch(e){location.hash=ch.id;}}
}
document.getElementById('pnext').onclick=function(){show(cur+1);};
document.getElementById('pprev').onclick=function(){show(cur-1);};
document.getElementById('topbtn').onclick=function(){window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});};
tocLinks.forEach(function(a){a.addEventListener('click',function(e){
  var id=a.getAttribute('href').slice(1);
  if(idIndex[id]!=null){e.preventDefault();show(idIndex[id]);rail.classList.remove('open');}
});});
window.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){
  if(e.target.tagName==='INPUT'||e.target.tagName==='TEXTAREA')return;
  if(e.key==='ArrowRight'||e.key==='j'||e.key==='J'){e.preventDefault();show(cur+1);}
  if(e.key==='ArrowLeft'||e.key==='k'||e.key==='K'){e.preventDefault();show(cur-1);}
});
function onScroll(){
  var h=document.documentElement;var max=h.scrollHeight-h.clientHeight;
  prog.style.width=(max>0?(h.scrollTop/max*100):0)+'%';
  document.getElementById('topbtn').classList.toggle('show',h.scrollTop>560);
}
window.addEventListener('scroll',onScroll,{passive:true});

document.getElementById('railToggle').addEventListener('click',function(){rail.classList.toggle('open');});

/* init from hash */
var initId=(location.hash||'').slice(1);
show(idIndex[initId]!=null?idIndex[initId]:0,false);
onScroll();
</script>
</body>
</html>
# giving-back · Component Vocabulary

Every class below is already defined in `assets/template.html`. Compose pages from these — **never invent class names, never add `<style>` or external CSS/JS, never emit raw markdown.** Inline `style=""` is allowed (used for `max-width`, accent colors, spacing).

Accent colors available everywhere: **clay** (house default), **blue**, **olive**, **plum**, **amber**, **rose**. Rotate them per section for variety; clay stays dominant.

---

## Page skeleton

Each "page" of the document is one section. They are shown one at a time (paged nav):

```html
<section class="chapter" id="chNN">
  <div class="wrap wide">   <!-- or class="wrap" for a narrower column -->
    … content …
  </div>
</section>
```
- `id="chNN"` must match a `#chNN` link in the rail `<nav class="toc">`.
- `<section class="chapter dark" …>` = a dark "scene" (cover / dividers / send-off).
- The first section is usually the cover (`ch00`), the last is the send-off.

## Header of a section
```html
<span class="chapnum reveal">NN — Short theme</span>
<div class="kicker reveal">tiny mono eyebrow</div>
<h2 class="title reveal d1" style="max-width:24ch">Headline with one <em>clay-italic phrase</em>.</h2>
<p class="lede reveal d2">One-sentence serif standfirst.</p>
<div class="pillrow reveal d2"><span class="pill clay">tag</span><span class="pill blue">tag</span></div>
```
`.display` = the biggest headline (cover only). `h3` = serif subhead, `h4` = small sans subhead.

## In-section contents bar (sticky) — for long sections with subsections
```html
<div class="chapnav reveal">
  <span class="cnl">In this chapter</span>
  <a href="#chNN-s1"><b>1</b>The Setup</a>
  <a href="#chNN-s2"><b>2</b>The Core Idea</a>
  …
</div>
```
Open each subsection with a numbered band (the `id` is the anchor target; add `blue`/`olive`/`plum`/`amber` to vary the badge color):
```html
<div class="subsec reveal" id="chNN-s3"><span class="sn">3</span>
  <h2 class="title" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,40px)">Inside the Code</h2></div>
```
Put `<hr class="divline reveal">` between subsections.

## Prose
```html
<div class="prose reveal" style="max-width:72ch">
  <p class="lead-in">Opening sentence, slightly larger.</p>
  <p>Body with <strong>bold key terms</strong>, <em>italic emphasis</em>, and inline code via
     <span class="mono" style="background:var(--paper-2);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:5px">/command</span>.</p>
</div>
<p class="note">italic muted side note</p>
```
`.dropcap` on a `<p>` gives a drop-cap first letter. `.small` = muted small text.

## Two-column layout — **use this to fill width; avoid lone narrow columns**
```html
<div class="spread" style="align-items:center">
  <div class="prose">…explanation…</div>
  <div class="fig">…an SVG figure…</div>
</div>
```
`.spread` is a 2-col grid (1.1fr / 0.9fr) with **exactly two direct children**; it collapses to one column on small screens. `.spread.rev` makes the left column the narrower one. Pair prose↔figure, quote↔figure, intro↔card-grid, code↔explanation, steps↔figure. Wrap loose content in a `<div>` so the spread always has two children.

## Pills / tags
```html
<div class="pillrow"><span class="pill clay">x</span><span class="pill blue">y</span></div>
<div class="tag-list"><span class="t">small tag</span></div>
```

## Cards
```html
<div class="grid grid-3">
  <div class="card accent reveal"><span class="cnum">01</span>
    <p class="ctitle">Title</p><p class="cbody">Body.</p></div>
  …
</div>
```
Variants: `card.accent` (clay top-rule), `card.blue`, `card.olive`, `card.plum`, `card.amber`, `card.glow` (gradient). Grids: `grid-2`, `grid-3`, `grid-4`.

## Stats (big numbers)
```html
<div class="stats reveal">
  <div class="stat"><div class="sv">10x</div><div class="sl">label</div></div>
  <div class="stat blue">…</div>
</div>
```

## Pull quotes
```html
<div class="quote reveal"><p>"verbatim quote."</p><span class="cite">— source</span></div>
<div class="quote big reveal"><p>Short punchy line.</p>
  <span class="cite" style="display:block;margin-top:10px">caption</span></div>
```
`.quote.big` is for short, high-impact lines. For a long sentence, use plain `.quote` (or pair `.quote.big` with a figure in a `.spread`) so it doesn't become tall and thin.

## Callouts
```html
<div class="callout reveal"><span class="ci">LABEL</span>
  <span class="cc">Body with <strong>bold</strong>.</span></div>
```
Variants: `callout.warn` (amber), `callout.ok` (olive), `callout.idea` (plum, good for "newcomer note"), `callout.bad` (rose).

## Steps (numbered process)
```html
<ol class="steps reveal">
  <li><h4>Step name</h4><p>What happens.</p></li>
</ol>
```

## Compare (before / after, wrong / right)
```html
<div class="compare reveal">
  <div class="col bad"><span class="clabel">◴ the old way</span><ul><li>point</li></ul></div>
  <div class="col good"><span class="clabel">◵ the new way</span><ul><li>point</li></ul></div>
</div>
```

## Code blocks (auto syntax-highlighted by the bundled JS)
```html
<div class="codecap">.config/commands/feature.md</div>   <!-- optional file label -->
<div class="code reveal"><pre>… your code …</pre></div>
```
- The bundled highlighter colorizes **bash, python, json, js/ts, yaml, and markdown** automatically by detecting the language from the `codecap` label or the code itself. You do NOT need to add `<span>` tints — but you may, with `.cm` (comment) `.k` (keyword) `.s` (string) `.v`/`.n` (var/number).
- ⚠ **Escape all code:** `&` → `&amp;`, `<` → `&lt;`, `>` → `&gt;`. A raw `<` or `>` inside `<pre>` breaks the page. Escape every placeholder like `&lt;issue-number&gt;`, shell redirects, generics, and markdown.
- Use `<kbd>J</kbd>` for keystrokes.

## File tree (dark)
```html
<div class="filetree reveal"><span class="d">dir/</span>
  <span class="f">file.py</span>  <span class="c"># note</span></div>
```
`.d` = directory (orange), `.f` = file, `.c` = comment, `.hl` = highlighted.

## Figures + hand-drawn animated SVG — **the signature element; ≥1–2 per section**
```html
<div class="fig reveal">
  <svg class="draw" viewBox="0 0 880 320" role="img" aria-label="what it shows">
     … shapes & labels …
  </svg>
  <div class="fcap"><b>Caption lead.</b> Explanatory tail.</div>
</div>
```
- `.fig.bare` = no frame/background.
- The `draw` class makes every stroke **animate (draw-in)** when the section is shown; `reveal` fades the block in.
- **SVG helper classes** (themed — use these): `s-card` (paper card), `s-clay-f`/`s-blue-f`/`s-olive-f`/`s-plum-f`/`s-amber-f` (soft tinted fill + colored stroke), `s-clay`/`s-ink`/`s-dim` (solid fills), `s-line` (neutral stroke, fill:none), `s-flow` (clay arrow, width 2), `s-title` (sans bold), `s-label` (mono 11px), `s-label-sm` (mono 9.5px muted), `s-serif`.
- Build **real conceptual diagrams** of the idea: stacks, layers, loops, ladders, pipelines, before/after, bar charts, hierarchies, timelines. Hand-place coordinates. Arrowheads: `<path d="M.. l6 6 6 -6" class="s-flow"/>` or a small filled triangle. viewBox width ~460–920, height ~200–340.

## Embedded image band (e.g. screenshots / "from the source")
```html
<div class="lecband reveal">
  <span class="lechead">From the source · Title</span>
  <p class="lecintro">Short intro (may use &lt;strong&gt; / &lt;em&gt;).</p>
  <div class="stillgrid">
    <figure class="still hero"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64,…"><figcaption><b>label</b>caption</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="still"><img src="…"><figcaption><b>label</b>caption</figcaption></figure>
  </div>
  <a class="watch" href="URL" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch / source &rarr;</a>
</div>
```
`figure.still.hero` spans the full width. Inline images as `data:` URIs to stay self-contained.

## Section footer
```html
<a class="jump reveal" href="#chNN_next">Next · Title &nbsp;→</a>
```

## Animation classes (apply liberally)
- `reveal` on most top-level blocks → fades/slides in when the section is shown.
- Stagger siblings with `d1 d2 d3 d4 d5 d6` (increasing transition-delay).
- `draw` on every `<svg>` → strokes draw themselves in.
- All motion respects `prefers-reduced-motion`.

## What the bundled JS gives you (already wired — don't re-implement)
- **Paged navigation:** one section visible at a time; `‹ NN / NN ›` pager (bottom-center); **← →** and **J/K** keys; rail-link clicks; `#hash` deep-links; a back-to-top **↑** button.
- **Sticky in-section nav** with the current subsection highlighted.
- **Syntax highlighting** of every `.code pre`.
- **Reveal-on-show + SVG draw-in** per page.
- **Reading-progress** bar; mobile rail toggle (`☰`).
# giving-back · Archetypes

Two output modes share the same design system.

## Mode A — Multi-chapter guide (paged "book")
A cover (`ch00`) → N content sections (`ch01…`) → a send-off. The rail TOC lists every section; readers turn pages with the pager / J–K / ← →. Use this for courses, field guides, long reports, documentation sets. **This is the default for anything with > ~3 sections.**

## Mode B — Single-page report / explainer
One or a few `<section class="chapter">` pages. Still uses the rail (a short TOC), the cover scene, and all components. Use for a single report, a comparison, a post-mortem, a design doc.

Pick the mode from the content's size. Either way, fill the body where the template has `<!--__CHAPTERS__-->`.

---

## Archetype: a content section (the workhorse)
Header → optional sticky `chapnav` → numbered subsections separated by `divline`, each pairing prose with a visual. Note the **`.spread`** usage to fill width.

```html
<section class="chapter" id="ch03">
  <div class="wrap wide">
    <span class="chapnum reveal">03 — The theme</span>
    <div class="kicker reveal">eyebrow line</div>
    <h2 class="title reveal d1" style="max-width:22ch">A headline with one <em>accent</em>.</h2>
    <p class="lede reveal d2">One-sentence standfirst.</p>
    <div class="pillrow reveal d2"><span class="pill clay">Lesson 3</span><span class="pill">Intermediate</span></div>

    <div class="chapnav reveal"><span class="cnl">In this chapter</span>
      <a href="#ch03-s1"><b>1</b>The Setup</a>
      <a href="#ch03-s2"><b>2</b>The Core Idea</a>
      <a href="#ch03-s3"><b>3</b>Inside It</a>
    </div>

    <hr class="divline reveal">
    <div class="subsec reveal" id="ch03-s1"><span class="sn">1</span>
      <h2 class="title" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,40px)">The Setup</h2></div>
    <div class="spread reveal" style="align-items:center">
      <div class="prose"><p class="lead-in">Open the idea…</p><p>Body…</p></div>
      <div class="fig"><svg class="draw" viewBox="0 0 480 300" role="img" aria-label="…">
        <rect x="30" y="40" width="180" height="60" rx="10" class="s-clay-f"/>
        <text x="120" y="76" text-anchor="middle" class="s-label">concept</text>
        <path d="M210 70 H 300" class="s-flow"/><path d="M300 70 l-9 -6 0 12 z" class="s-clay"/>
      </svg><div class="fcap"><b>The idea, drawn.</b> caption.</div></div>
    </div>

    <hr class="divline reveal">
    <div class="subsec reveal blue" id="ch03-s2"><span class="sn">2</span>
      <h2 class="title" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,40px)">The Core Idea</h2></div>
    <div class="spread rev reveal">
      <div class="quote big"><p>A short, sharp line.</p><span class="cite" style="display:block;margin-top:10px">— source</span></div>
      <div class="prose"><p>Explanation paired with the quote so the row fills the width.</p></div>
    </div>

    <a class="jump reveal" href="#ch04">Next · the following section &nbsp;→</a>
  </div>
</section>
```

## Archetype: code walkthrough subsection
```html
<div class="subsec reveal plum" id="ch03-s3"><span class="sn">3</span>
  <h2 class="title" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,40px)">Inside the Code</h2></div>
<div class="filetree reveal"><span class="d">commands/</span>
  <span class="f">feature.md</span>  <span class="c"># the slash command</span></div>
<div class="spread reveal" style="align-items:start">
  <div>
    <div class="codecap">commands/feature.md</div>
    <div class="code"><pre><span class="cm"># build a feature from an issue</span>
read the issue &lt;issue-number&gt;, then write a plan to specs/</pre></div>
  </div>
  <div class="prose"><p>Explain what the file does and how it is used, beside the code.</p></div>
</div>
```

---

## The anti-pattern to avoid
A long single column of `.prose` with the right half of the page empty. If a block has no natural visual partner, either (a) pull a `.quote`/`.callout`/`.stats` out beside it in a `.spread`, or (b) add a small bespoke SVG. **Never leave a tall narrow column with large empty space to its right.**

---

## Assembling (Mode A with many sections)
For big documents, write each section to its own `chapters/chNN.html` fragment, then inline them at the `<!--__CHAPTERS__-->` marker with `assets/assemble.py` (loops the fragments, replaces the marker, writes a single self-contained `index.html`). For small documents, just paste the sections directly into the template at the marker.

