The chapter draft now has twelve complete ten-move teaching cycles, all twelve 1920×1080 frames at full width, two evidence-approved current-practice videos, thirty retrieval disclosures, and a non-destructive 100-point lab. The codebase audit caught and corrected several extract-level lab hazards: the core lab is keyless, the baseline is 34 passing tests, the stale database should be moved rather than deleted, and the six endpoints do not all handle errors identically.
