 ## Measured density
 
-- Visible-text estimate: **11,912 words** (HTML tags, CSS, and progress script excluded)
-- Print-equivalent estimate: **44–50 pages**, depending on frame placement and browser print pagination
-- Teaching cycles: **12 of 12**, each with Hook → Picture → Story → Name → Worked example → You try → Fail/fix → Current Practice → Retrieval → Teach-back
-- Course frames: **12 of 12**, all full-width breakout cards with timestamps and explanatory captions
-- Cumulative retrieval: **16 of 16** extract questions included
-- Current-practice YouTube overlays: **2** (hGg3nWp7afg, X2ciJedw2vU); deferred ADW video intentionally omitted
+- **Visible teaching text:** approximately **8,205 words** (HTML tags and script excluded)
+- **Print-equivalent estimate:** approximately **36–44 dense pages**
+- Estimate basis: 12 complete ten-move teaching cycles, 12 full-width 1920×1080 lesson frames, one generated hero plate, four designed HTML systems, 30 answer disclosures, a five-part 100-point lab, cumulative mastery, and glossary. The large frames, diagrams, lab cards, and forced major-section print starts lower words per page versus plain prose.
+- **Pedagogy:** 12/12 major ideas include Hook → Picture → Story → Name → Worked example → You try → Fail/fix → Current Practice → Retrieval → Teach-back.
+- **Extract retrieval coverage:** 16/16 required questions represented.
+- **Current-practice YouTube overlays:** 2 (`hGg3nWp7afg`, `X2ciJedw2vU`); the deferred ADW/end-state video remains omitted.
 
 ## Accuracy locks preserved
 
-- The committed repository is shown as the broken before-state: zero stdout prints in server.py and no sanitizer in file_processor.py.
-- The stdout diff, sanitizer, sanitizer test, and start.md are labeled as demo/lab-created artifacts.
-- The exact planted failure is orders_(32) reaching PRAGMA table_info({table_name}) at app/server/core/file_processor.py:26.
-- No CLAUDE.md is claimed to exist in TAC-2; README plus /prime carry the briefing role.
-- adws/ and agents/ are described as empty scaffolding, not implemented workflows.
-- The course-era tool roster and 300-second foreground timeout are separated from the current background-task pattern.
-- Labs stay inside tac/tac-2 and exclude external-repo work, architecture refactors, MCP construction, frontend agent testing, and a full ADW build.
+- The committed repository is the broken before-state: `server.py` has zero `print()` calls and `file_processor.py` has no sanitizer.
+- Logging, the sanitizer, the sanitizer tests, and `start.md` are labeled as agent-created demo/lab artifacts.
+- The planted chain is stated precisely: `server.py:60` derives `orders_(32)`; pandas creates the table; `file_processor.py:26` fails at unquoted `PRAGMA table_info(orders_(32))`.
+- The six endpoints are not falsely described as having identical error behavior; the shared deficiency is missing detailed handler stdout.
+- No `CLAUDE.md` is claimed to ship. `README.md` plus `/prime` carry the cold-start briefing role.
+- `adws/` and `agents/` are empty scaffolding, not finished workflows.
