+  <meta name="description" content="A teaching-first companion to TAC-2: The 12 Leverage Points. Learn to adopt the agent's perspective, stack the Core Four with eight through-agent levers, and diagnose failed runs.">
+  <title>TAC-2 · The 12 Leverage Points — IndyDevDan Expert Book</title>
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../design/tokens.css">
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../design/base.css">
