+
+    <main class="chapter-main" id="main-content">
+      <header class="hero">
+        <span class="hero__chapter">Tactic #2 · Adopt Your Agent’s Perspective</span>
+        <h1>The 12 Leverage Points</h1>
+        <p class="hero__dek">Agentic success is not a lucky prompt. It is a stack of visible levers that let a brilliant but blind agent see, navigate, act, verify, and improve.</p>
+        <ul class="hero__meta" aria-label="Chapter details">
+          <li>Video spine · 47:14</li>
+          <li>Lab · 75–120 min</li>
+          <li>Course repo · tac/tac-2</li>
+          <li>Level · beginner → diagnostic operator</li>
+        </ul>
+        <p class="hero__promise"><strong>Mastery promise.</strong> By the end, you will name all twelve leverage points in two families, diagnose a silent production-shaped failure, make the agent observe and repair it, trace a type through five real files, close a test loop, and measure progress with size, attempts, streak, and presence.</p>
+        <figure class="frame-card generated-plate generated-plate--hero">
+          <img src="../media/generated/plate-12-leverage-points.png" alt="Illustrated concept plate arranging the twelve leverage points around an agentic engineering system" width="1536" height="1024" fetchpriority="high">
+          <figcaption>The chapter’s map: the Core Four travel with the agent; eight more levers shape what can flow through it.</figcaption>
+        </figure>
+      </header>
+
+      <div class="mobile-toc">
+        <details>
+          <summary>Chapter contents</summary>
+          <ol>
+            <li><a href="#orientation">Orientation</a></li><li><a href="#idea-sdlc">The durable loop</a></li>
+            <li><a href="#idea-perspective">Agent perspective</a></li><li><a href="#idea-map">The twelve-point map</a></li>
+            <li><a href="#idea-tools">Tools</a></li><li><a href="#idea-stdout">Standard out</a></li>
+            <li><a href="#idea-system">Fix the system</a></li><li><a href="#idea-types">Types as IDKs</a></li>
+            <li><a href="#idea-architecture">Architecture</a></li><li><a href="#idea-docs">Documentation</a></li>
+            <li><a href="#idea-tests">Tests</a></li><li><a href="#idea-ladder">Plans to ADWs</a></li>
+            <li><a href="#idea-kpis">Four KPIs</a></li><li><a href="#lab">Graded lab</a></li>
+            <li><a href="#mastery">Mastery check</a></li><li><a href="#glossary">Glossary</a></li>
+          </ol>
